{"seq":3,"slug":"aquaculture-biotech","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 水产养殖生物技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/animal-biotech/aquaculture-biotech","wordCount":1990,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-农业生物技术-水产养殖生物技术\">研究生 农业生物技术 — 水产养殖生物技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>水产养殖生物技术将分子生物学、基因组学和生殖操控技术应用于鱼类、虾蟹和贝藻等水产生物的遗传改良和健康管理。随着全球水产养殖产量超过捕捞渔业，养殖品种的遗传改良成为保障水产品供给的关键技术路径。从性别控制到基因组选择，从疾病抗性育种到全鱼多倍体诱导，水产生物技术正经历着从经验育种到精准育种的转型。</p>\n<p>核心领域包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>性别控制技术</strong>：利用遗传、激素或环境因素调控养殖鱼类的性别比例</li>\n<li><strong>多倍体诱导</strong>：通过物理或化学方法抑制减数分裂或有丝分裂产生三倍体/四倍体</li>\n<li><strong>水产基因组选择</strong>：基于高密度SNP标记的育种值预测和选种</li>\n<li><strong>疾病抗性育种</strong>：利用分子标记或基因编辑增强养殖品种的抗病能力</li>\n<li><strong>转基因鱼类</strong>：导入外源生长激素基因或抗冻蛋白基因的基因工程鱼类</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"鱼类性别决定与控制\">鱼类性别决定与控制</h3><p>性别控制在水产养殖中具有直接的经济价值。许多养殖鱼类存在显著的性别二态性——如虹鳟和罗非鱼中雄鱼生长更快，而大菱鲆中雌鱼体型更大。鱼类性别决定机制的多样性远超哺乳动物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物种</th>\n<th>性别决定系统</th>\n<th>主性别决定基因</th>\n<th>养殖偏好性别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尼罗罗非鱼</td>\n<td>XX/XY</td>\n<td><em>amh</em> (Y连锁)</td>\n<td>雄性（生长快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大西洋鲑鱼</td>\n<td>XX/XY</td>\n<td><em>sdY</em></td>\n<td>雌性（晚成熟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半滑舌鳎</td>\n<td>ZW/ZZ</td>\n<td><em>dmrt1</em></td>\n<td>雌性（体型大2-3倍）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虹鳟</td>\n<td>XX/XY</td>\n<td><em>sdY</em></td>\n<td>雌性（延迟成熟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日本牙鲆</td>\n<td>XX/XY</td>\n<td><em>amhr2</em></td>\n<td>雌性（体型大）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>全雌化技术路径</strong>（以虹鳟为例）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用雌二醇（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17</mn><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-estradiol, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> mg/kg饲料）处理XY基因型仔鱼，诱导其表型雌性化（伪雌鱼, neofemale）</li>\n<li>伪雌鱼（XY基因型但表型为雌性）与正常雄鱼（XY）交配，后代中出现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> YY超级雄鱼</li>\n<li>YY雄鱼与正常XX雌鱼交配，后代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span> 为XY雄鱼</li>\n<li>或：XX基因型雌鱼经雄性激素处理产生XX伪雄鱼，与正常XX雌鱼交配，后代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span> 为XX雌鱼</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"多倍体诱导技术\">多倍体诱导技术</h3><p>三倍体鱼类因无法正常进行减数分裂而不育，这一特性在水产养殖中具有双重价值：消除性成熟对生长的负面影响，以及防止养殖逃逸个体与野生群体杂交的生态风险。</p>\n<p><strong>三倍体诱导方法</strong>：在受精卵排出第二极体之前，施加物理或化学休克抑制第二极体排出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>热休克</strong>：26-28°C温水处理（冷水鱼种），持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> min</li>\n<li><strong>冷休克</strong>：0-4°C冷水处理（温水鱼种），持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> min</li>\n<li><strong>静水压处理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span></span></span></span></span> MPa压力处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> min，是目前效率最高的方法</li>\n<li><strong>化学处理</strong>：细胞松弛素B（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L）抑制微丝组装</li>\n</ul>\n<p>诱导效率的关键在于处理时间窗口——必须在第二极体释放前（即受精后特定时间内）施加处理。以虹鳟为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 水温下，受精后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> min为最佳静水压处理窗口。</p>\n<p>三倍体验证方法包括流式细胞术（DNA含量分析）、红细胞核体积测量和微卫星标记分析。其中流式细胞术是金标准，三倍体细胞的DNA含量为二倍体的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> 倍：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DNA_{3n} = 1.5 \\times DNA_{2n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"水产基因组选择\">水产基因组选择</h3><p>水产基因组选择面临与陆生畜禽不同的特殊挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>家系规模大（单个交配可产数千卵），家系内变异丰富</li>\n<li>许多经济性状需要破坏性测量（如胴体品质、抗病力）</li>\n<li>世代间隔短（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 年），加速遗传进展的边际效益相对较小</li>\n<li>基因组资源（参考基因组、SNP芯片）发展滞后于畜禽</li>\n</ul>\n<p>已开发的水产专用SNP芯片：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大西洋鲑鱼：Axiom® SalmoSNP芯片（约200K SNP）</li>\n<li>虹鳟：Affymetrix 57K芯片</li>\n<li>大西洋鳕鱼：Illumina 12K和60K芯片</li>\n<li>凡纳滨对虾：自主开发的50K芯片</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>抗病性状的基因组选择</strong>是水产GS最具价值的应用方向。传统表型选择中，抗病力测定需要对候选鱼进行攻毒实验，不可能在育种候选个体本身上实施。基因组选择通过同胞攻毒测定构建参考群，利用基因组标记将抗病性状的GEBV传递到无需攻毒的候选群体中。</p>\n<p>大西洋鲑鱼抗传染性胰腺坏死病（IPN）的QTL定位发现，第26号连锁群上存在一个解释超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 遗传变异的主效QTL，对应基因为 <em>epithelial cadherin</em>（<em>cdh1</em>）。利用该QTL的分子标记进行MAS，已在挪威鲑鱼养殖中显著降低了IPN发病率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"aquadvantage转基因三文鱼\">AquAdvantage转基因三文鱼</h3><p>AquAdvantage三文鱼是全球首个获批食用的转基因动物。该品种在大西洋鲑鱼基因组中导入了大鳞大马哈鱼（Chinook salmon）生长激素基因，由大洋鳕鱼（Ocean pout）的抗冻蛋白基因启动子驱动全年持续表达。结果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生长速度比野生型快约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 倍</li>\n<li>达到上市规格（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> kg）仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 个月（vs 传统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span> 个月）</li>\n<li>为全雌三倍体，理论上不育，降低生态逃逸风险</li>\n<li>2015年获美国FDA批准，2016年获加拿大批准</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>比较鱼类XX/XY和ZW/ZZ两种性别决定系统的全雌化育种策略的异同。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个三倍体虹鳟的规模化生产方案，包括诱导条件优化、倍性验证和养殖管理要点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某研究者发现一个与对虾白斑综合征病毒（WSSV）抗性相关的QTL，解释了约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span> 的遗传变异。讨论应该采用MAS还是GS策略进行抗病育种。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析AquAdvantage转基因三文鱼的全雌三倍体设计如何同时解决生长速度、生态安全和食品安全三方面的关切。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>水产养殖中基因组选择的参考群体设计有何特殊考虑？讨论家系结构对预测准确性的影响。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>水产基因组学</strong>：Yáñez et al. (2015) &quot;Genomics in Aquaculture to Better Understand Species Biology and Accelerate Genetic Progress&quot; <em>Frontiers in Genetics</em></li>\n<li><strong>性别控制</strong>：Devlin &amp; Nagahama (2002) &quot;Sex Determination and Sex Differentiation in Fish&quot; <em>Aquaculture</em></li>\n<li><strong>三倍体技术</strong>：Piferrer et al. (2009) &quot;Polyploid Fish and Shellfish: Production, Biology and Applications to Aquaculture&quot; <em>Aquaculture</em></li>\n<li><strong>转基因鱼类监管</strong>：关注FDA和EFSA对转基因水产动物的环境风险评估标准</li>\n<li><strong>中国水产育种</strong>：了解黄海水产研究所和淡水渔业研究中心在水产基因组选择方面的进展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>水产养殖生物技术整合了性别控制、多倍体诱导、基因组选择和基因工程等多种工具，为养殖品种的遗传改良提供了系统性解决方案。鱼类性别决定机制的多样性为性别控制提供了丰富的操作入口，三倍体不育特性同时服务于生长改良和生态安全目标。基因组选择正在快速渗透到主要养殖品种的育种体系中，特别是在抗病性状改良方面展现出巨大潜力。理解不同物种的生殖生物学特性和遗传资源背景，是设计合理育种方案和评估新技术应用前景的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 水产养殖生物技术","id":"研究生-农业生物技术-水产养殖生物技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"鱼类性别决定与控制","id":"鱼类性别决定与控制"},{"level":3,"text":"多倍体诱导技术","id":"多倍体诱导技术"},{"level":3,"text":"水产基因组选择","id":"水产基因组选择"},{"level":3,"text":"AquAdvantage转基因三文鱼","id":"aquadvantage转基因三文鱼"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 动物克隆技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/animal-biotech/cloning-technology"},"next":{"title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 土壤微生物组","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/microbial-biotech/soil-microbiome"}}